{title: Tumhare Siva Kuch Na}
{artist: Tum Bin Udit Narayan Anuradha Paudwal}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Cm]Tumhare siwa kuch na chahat [Fm]karenge,        Ke jab tak [A#]jiyenge mohabbat [Cm]karenge
[Cm]Mohabbat mohabbat, mohabbat mohabbat,        [Cm]Nazar chahati hai deedar [Fm]karna
Ye dil chah [A#]ta hai tumhe pyaar [Cm]karna,        [Cm]Tumhari wafa mein doobe [Fm]rahein hum
Hai kya haal [A#]dil ka ye kaise [Cm]kahe hum,        [Cm]Mehakne lagega [Cm]oo [A#]oo [G#] .. [Cm]
[Cm]Mehakne lagega badan yeh [Fm]tumhara,        Hum aankho se [A#]aisi shararat [Cm]karenge
[Cm]Tumhare siwa kuch na chahat [Fm]karenge,        Ke jab tak [A#]jiyenge mohabbat [Cm]karenge
[Cm]Hume apne dil me basaya hai [Fm]tumne,        Mohabbat ke [A#]kabil banaya hai [Cm]tumne
[Cm]Agar tum na milte to hum ji na [Fm]paate,        Kise apna [A#]kehte kahan dil [Cm]lagaate
[Cm]Saza Rab jo dega [Cm]oo [A#]oo [G#] .. [Cm],        [Cm]Saza rab jo dega woh manzoor [Fm]humko
Ke ab hum [A#]tumhari ibadat [Cm]karenge,        [Cm]Tumhare siwa kuch na chahat [Fm]karenge
Ke jab tak [A#]jiyenge mohabbat [Cm]karenge
